     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am trying to plot vertical standard error lines on a faceted plot. <div><br></div><div>I have already done so with a mean value using the following code: </div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(13,32,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">med.fac</span> = ddply(Length<span style=\"color:#000000\">_wk</span>, .(<span style=\"color:#000000\">Year</span>), <span style=\"color:#c3892a\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">.d</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(13,32,153)\">data.frame(<span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span>=median(<span style=\"color:#000000\">.d</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">FL</span>)))</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"></p><p style=\"color:rgb(13,32,153);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\">g + geom_vline(data=med.fac, aes(xintercept=x), type=<span style=\"color:#af130b\">&quot;dashed&quot;</span>)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(13,32,153);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\">Now, I&#39;d like to add standard error and eventually the 95% confidence interval. I&#39;ve tried similar code as above and added a function for standard error (see below) however it does not achieve anything. </font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(13,32,153);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">se </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#c3892a\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span>)<span style=\"color:#000000\"> </span>sqrt(var(<span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span>)/length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span>))</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(13,32,153);background-color:rgb(238,238,238);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">med.fac4 <span style=\"color:#0d2099\">= ddply(</span>Length_wk<span style=\"color:#0d2099\">, .(</span>Year<span style=\"color:#0d2099\">), </span><span style=\"color:#c3892a\">function</span><span style=\"color:#0d2099\">(</span>.d<span style=\"color:#0d2099\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(13,32,153);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">data.frame(<span style=\"color:#000000\">x</span>=se(<span style=\"color:#000000\">.d</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">FL</span>)))</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(13,32,153);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-family:Consolas;color:rgb(13,32,153);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">g + geom_vline(data=med.fac4, aes(xintercept=x), linetype=<span style=\"color:#af130b\">&quot;dashed&quot;</span>, color=<span style=\"color:#af130b\">&quot;blue&quot;</span>)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">Any thoughts? </p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco\">Thanks</p><p></p><p></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(13,32,153);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(13,32,153);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(13,32,153);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:12.1px;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p></p></div></div>"
